# Host functions the macOS guest imports: those of the ILP32 runtime it
# shares with Android (declared in port/android/guest/runtime/guest_host.h),
# the Mac's own (port/macos/include/macos_host.h) and the Metal renderer's
# (port/macos/include/halo_metal.h), all defined in port/macos/host.
# tools/macos_imports.py generates the stubs, from those prototypes.
